t the dual status of this population group as both displaced and stateless. This approach was used for India for the first time in 2019. The reported figure does not represent an estimate of the entire stateless population.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2021,"population_type":"STA","text":"The total statelessness figure reported relates to 20,154 stateless persons of Rohingya ethnicity who are also counted as refugees or asylum-seekers from Myanmar, mainly from Rakhine State. The reported figure does not represent an estimate of the entire stateless population.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2022,"population_type":"STA","text":"The total statelessness figure reported relates to 21,591 stateless persons of Rohingya ethnicity who are also counted as refugees or asylum-seekers from Myanmar, mainly from Rakhine State. The reported figure does not represent an estimate of the entire stateless population.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2023,"population_type":"STA","text":"The total statelessness figure reported relates to 22,646 stateless persons of Rohingya ethnicity who are also counted as refugees or asylum-seekers from Myanmar, mainly from Rakhine State. The reported figure does not represent an estimate of the entire stateless population.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2024,"population_type":"STA","text":"The total statelessness figure reported relates to 23,262 stateless persons of Rohingya ethnicity who are also counted as refugees or asylum-seekers from Myanmar, mainly from Rakhine State. The reported figure does not represent an estimate of the entire stateless population.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2025,"population_type":"STA","text":"The total statelessness figure reported relates to 22,694 stateless persons of Rohingya ethnicity who are also counted as refugees or asylum-seekers from Myanmar, mainly from Rakhine State. The reported figure does not represent an estimate of the entire stateless population.","view":"asylum"}],"sources":["unhcr_countries","unhcr_population","unhcr_de